__pycache__/
*.pyc
~$*.xlsx

# Run workbooks contain real ServiceNow ticket data.
# NOTE: the Proposed Masters running tally lives inside the newest workbook in
# runs/, so if the team is to share one tally, the current workbook must be
# committed. Decide deliberately before relaxing this — see README.
runs/*
!runs/.gitkeep

# Ground-truth workbooks for measure.py contain real ticket data. The folder and
# its README are tracked; the data files are not.
reference/truth/*
!reference/truth/README.md
